    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11987" root="دبخ" body-key="d">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دبّخ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَدْبِيخٌ</span>, <i>He</i> (a man, S) <i>made his
back round like a dome</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَبَّبَهُ</span>) <i>and lowered his
head;</i> (S, K;) as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دبّح</span> [q. v.]; with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ح</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خ</span>, on the authority of AA and IAar. (S.)

